  "title": "EdaTime",
  "bodyText": "Preparation\n?\nPreparation help\nFilter and calculate in Signals, refine the steps here, and use the current working dataset in every plot.\nInspect in Signals\nGraph and history\nFocus view\nProfile findings\nPipeline preview\nPipeline stages\nExport\nRecord an insight\nSOURCE\nsource-5\nREVISION\n5\nACTIVE STAGES\n0\nPLAN STATUS\nSource baseline\nCurrent pipeline\nEnabled steps run in order for all plots and dataset exports. Changes are reversible with Undo and Redo.\nSource baseline — add a stage to produce a post-pipeline preview.\nKeep Signals time window\nOrdered stages\nThese controls change the active canonical plan. Preview its exact impact here, then create a prepared dataset when the result is ready.\nUndo\nRedo\nPreview baseline\nCreate prepared dataset\nChoose one transformation, configure it, then add it to the ordered plan.\nMissing values\nDuplicate rows\nColumn selection\nStable sort\nOrdered null fill\nFixed-duration resampling\nCalculate / combine columns\nAdd missing-value policy\nDrop null rows\nDrop non-finite rows\nAdd stage\nNo transformations have been added yet. Create one from Signals or open the workbench.\nExport dataset and pipeline\nDownload all rows and columns after the enabled steps as Parquet. Export the same pipeline as JSON or Python / Rust code, or download a bundle with the plan, code, and provenance. Exporting does not require creating a prepared dataset.\nDownload dataset (Parquet)\nExport plan JSON\nExport Python\nExport Rust\nExport reproducibility bundle\nQuality findings\nImmediate source-profile findings can be turned into reversible stages. Build a bounded sample or exact quality report for a cached, versioned follow-up.\nBuild sampled quality reportBuild exact quality report\nColumn quality findings are pending the exact profile.",
